{"id":"fugitif","lemma":"fugitif","pos":"noun","rank":4686,"glosses":["fugitive"],"ipa":"/fy.ʒi.tif/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-fugitif.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-fugitif.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"fugitifs","feminine":"fugitive"},"formAudio":{"fugitive":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LuneMarine_%28DSwissK%29-fugitive.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le temps est fugitif.","en":"Time is fleeting.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Le fugitif a traversé la rivière.","en":"The fugitive crossed the river.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to cross, to go across","l":"traverser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"a river"}]},{"text":"Les prisonniers fugitifs sont toujours en cavale.","en":"The escaped prisoners are still on the run.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"prisoner","l":"prisonnier"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"always"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"on the run, on the lam"]]},{"text":"Le fugitif se précipita vers la frontière.","en":"The fugitive made a run for the border.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"towards"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"boundary"}]},{"text":"Le fugitif traversa la rivière.","en":"The fugitive crossed the river.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to cross, to go across","l":"traverser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"a river"}]}]}